# Sancho .gitignore
# WHY: the repo is knowledge only. Media, audio, and anything big lives elsewhere
#      (raw audio in ~/Sync/Sancho-Audio, images wherever they're used from).
# WHAT: blocks media and junk from ever being staged. The pre-commit hook in
#      _setup/hooks/pre-commit is the second line of defense (size cap).
# TEST: `touch test.mp3 && git status` should NOT show test.mp3. Delete it after.

# --- audio / video ---
*.mp3
*.wav
*.m4a
*.aac
*.flac
*.ogg
*.opus
*.wma
*.mp4
*.mov
*.m4v
*.avi
*.mkv
*.webm

# --- images ---
*.png
*.jpg
*.jpeg
*.gif
*.webp
*.heic
*.heif
*.bmp
*.tiff
*.tif
*.psd
*.ai

# --- archives / binaries ---
*.zip
*.tar
*.gz
*.7z
*.dmg
*.pkg
*.exe
*.bin
*.sqlite
*.sqlite3
*.db

# --- machine state ---
.DS_Store
._*
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
*.swp
*.tmp
*~
.sync/
.syncignore

# --- secrets: never in the repo ---
.env
.env.*
*.key
*.pem
secrets/
credentials/

# --- scratch ---
_scratch/
_quarantine/**/*.bak

# SVG is allowed (it's text and the system map may be SVG). PDFs are allowed under
# the size cap but should be summarized to Markdown, not hoarded.
